This product includes software developed for the Clean Energy Materials Platform
(CEMP). The source code is licensed under Apache-2.0.

Public demo data and public data/model assets referenced by this repository are
licensed under CC BY 4.0 unless a manifest entry states otherwise.

Third-party software and data sources used by CEMP include Django, Django REST
framework, django-cors-headers, django-cron, RDKit, pandas, scikit-learn,
XGBoost, PyTorch, PyTorch Geometric, CairoSVG, Beautiful Soup, Vue, Vite,
Element Plus, Axios, Materials Project data accessed through mp-api, and
scientific tools such as ORCA, Gaussian, GROMACS, and Multiwfn when optional
workflow modules are enabled. Their original licenses and citation requirements
remain in force.

Materials Project API keys are never stored in this repository. Users who run
data-refresh scripts must provide their own key through MP_API_KEY.

The external-scientific-software workflows are optional for the public demo.
The local reproducibility path uses public demo data, public model assets, and
precomputed records, so private servers are not required for the core checks.
